+    Below the threshold, do not read vertices at all. For a large scan the
+    two (N, 3) bound arrays are necessary; temporary corner gathers are not.
+    Keeping each gather to INDEX_BLOCK rows bounds its extra memory even
+    when the imported drawing contains millions of triangles.
+    """
+    n = len(triangles)
